+---
+id: ex-qftx-finite-regulator-torus-ward-identity
+kind: example
+title: A finite Q-exact torus integral with constant value
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
