+---
+id: def-qftx-supersymmetry-fluctuation-complex
+kind: definition
+title: Gauge-fixed supersymmetry fluctuation data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
